### ダウンロードしたファイルのopenssl検証
証明書をCAで検証:
dl-uitest.crt.pem: OK
Subject/EKU/期限:
  subject=CN=uitest, O=VPN
  notAfter=Feb 13 04:04:57 2029 GMT
  X509v3 Extended Key Usage: 
      TLS Web Client Authentication
秘密鍵と証明書の対応: cert=d613379d2f8b9d14 key=d613379d2f8b9d14 MATCH
p12(正しいパスワード):
  MAC: sha1, Iteration 2048
  PKCS7 Encrypted data: pbeWithSHA1And3-KeyTripleDES-CBC, Iteration 2048
  Shrouded Keybag: pbeWithSHA1And3-KeyTripleDES-CBC, Iteration 2048
p12(誤パスワード):
  Mac verify error: invalid password?

### VPN接続: UIで発行した証明書+パスワード
== uitest (password: correct)
[IKE] IKE_SA c[1] established between 192.168.90.2[uitest]...192.168.90.10[vpn.example.com]
[IKE] CHILD_SA c{1} established with SPIs c2b9e0a6_i c8ea5f72_o and TS 192.168.90.130/32 === 0.0.0.0/0
== uitest (password: WRONG)
initiate failed: establishing CHILD_SA 'c' failed
[IKE] EAP-MS-CHAPv2 failed with error ERROR_AUTHENTICATION_FAILURE: '(null)'
[IKE] EAP_MSCHAPV2 method failed

### B: UIで再発行 (旧証明書は失効、パスワード更新)
PASS 再発行でパスワードが変わる

